<h1>Install Dekopon</h1>
<p>On an Apple Silicon Mac, start with the <a href="/deploy/mac/">native Mac path</a>: a Slack Agent for one GitHub review channel, read-only access for an owner and colleague, and a budgeted OpenRouter key. Linux archives and a Kubernetes chart provide the same broker and gateway for server deployments.</p>
</header>
